*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0016
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-04-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 707
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0016.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TRAN-AMT           PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> ORIGIN COUNTRY CODE
    05 COUNTRY-CD         PIC X(2).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> MANUAL REVIEW FLAG
    05 FLAG-REVIEW        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    PERFORM CHECK-REGION
    DISPLAY "FLAG-REVIEW=" FLAG-REVIEW
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF CUST-AGE < 16
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR - LIMIT 15 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CUST-AGE < 21
       AND TRAN-AMT > 8500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FLAG-REVIEW
    END-IF.
CHECK-REGION.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF TRAN-AMT > 60000
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> LARGE TRANSACTION FROM HIGH-RISK REGION - LIMIT 56250 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF TRAN-AMT > 75000
       AND (COUNTRY-CD = 'XB' OR COUNTRY-CD = 'XD')
        MOVE 'Y' TO FLAG-REVIEW
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING WS-INPUT
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
